Z||000004||DXR_DAD||03-04-2000||12:19 PM||||This is the 2nd fiero in the family. It was a east bay (Oakland)car that I picked up from a shop that had just put a clutch in it  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> the body and paint are in Excelent Condition!!It did not run very well, but I have been reading posts from from The-ogre and have got alot of info on this DIS (Thanks) <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">. With the replacement of all the sensors, a complete tune-up (All parts new)Replaced the exhaust system from the manifold to the tip, new cat., muffler,& pipes now it runs like a champ.<BR>I re-did the headlinner, recovered the seats (Used) fixed a few interior parts. I don't know if I'll keep it or not? I've had it now for about seven months and I drive it more than my Little Black Toy the 86SE, (keeping the miles down) DXR_MOM wants a 88GT <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif">  &lt;And So It Shall Be&gt; <P>Thanks||||reg||1
